  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:36px\"><strong>真实火把</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"http://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding/minecraft-mods/2517826-realistic-torches\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Minecraft 论坛</a>&nbsp; - &nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/MattCzyr/RealisticTorches\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">源代码</a>&nbsp; - &nbsp;<a href=\"https://github.com/MattCzyr/RealisticTorches/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题追踪</a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>真实火把通过使火把在可配置的时间后熄灭，使早期游戏变得更加困难，鼓励玩家尽早转向更持久的光源。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:18pt\"><strong>特性</strong></span></p><ul>\n<li>火把在制作后是未点燃的，必须使用火柴盒或打火石点燃</li>\n<li>火把将在可配置的时间后熄灭（默认60分钟真实时间）</li>\n<li>火把在雨天会被熄灭</li>\n<li>在原版结构中生成的火把将被替换为未点燃的火把</li>\n<li>可以使用荧石制作永久点燃的火把</li>\n<li>自然发光的方块和物品在手持时会发光（1.14.4之前版本）</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:x-large\"><strong><strong>配方</strong></strong></span></p><p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/oQWLX8N.png\" alt=\"未点燃的火把（煤炭或木炭）\" width=\"376\" height=\"180\"></p><p><em>未点燃的火把（煤炭或木炭）</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/z0BxMQU.png\" alt=\"火柴盒\" width=\"378\" height=\"181\"></p><p><em>火柴盒</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/2FHuHQi.png\" alt=\"点燃的火把（无序合成，火柴盒会受损）\" width=\"379\" height=\"181\"></p><p><em>点燃的火把（无序合成，火柴盒会受损）</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/tcowSUW.png\" alt=\"荧石晶体（煤炭或木炭）\" width=\"379\" height=\"182\"></em></p><p><em>荧石晶体（煤炭或木炭）</em></p><p><em>&nbsp;</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Nt6fTDz.png\" alt=\"荧石糊（无序合成）\" width=\"380\" height=\"213\"></em></p><p><em>荧石糊（无序合成）</em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/vpSV7pX.png\" alt=\"原版火把（荧石晶体）\" width=\"379\" height=\"180\"></em></p><p><em>原版火把（荧石晶体）<br></em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><em><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/otOc8ue.png\" alt=\"原版火把（荧石糊）\" width=\"381\" height=\"214\"></em></p><p><em><em>原版火把（荧石糊）</em><br></em></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong><span style=\"font-size:18pt\">整合包</span></strong></p><p>是的，你可以在你的整合包中使用这个模组。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>支持</strong></span></p><p>如果你喜欢这个模组并想支持这个项目，欢迎在<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f235729%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253dmattczyr%2540gmail.com%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fprojects%252f235729%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dRealistic%2bTorches%2b(from%2bcurseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" rel=\"nofollow\">PayPal上捐赠</a>。非常感谢你的支持！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>赞助</strong></span></p><p>本项目由BisectHosting赞助。如果你在寻找服务器，<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fchaos\" rel=\"nofollow\">查看他们的托管计划</a>并在结账时使用优惠码<em>Chaos</em>，即可享受首月25%的折扣！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fchaos\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/0998de1c-6d3e-4370-a553-0da42e986c68.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>",
